.TH NOTELETS 7
.SH NAME
notelets - small Termscript applications in DiftrayWM cells
.SH DESCRIPTION
Notelets are Termscript applications rendered in NCursor cells. The bundled
hello Notelet is available in a normal build.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
:notelet list
List available Notelets.
.TP
:notelet open {name}
Open a Notelet in the active NCursor.
.TP
:notelet close
Close the focused Notelet cell.
.SH SEE ALSO
See notelets/README.md in the DiftrayWM source tree for the archive format and
Termscript authoring API.
